1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
No algorithm decides who gets helped here.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,600
A person does.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,400
Let me show you.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,400
When somebody can help, a
coordinator proposes the match.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,200
Both sides get a plain yes or no,
and nothing is revealed yet.

6
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,400
And when both say yes, there it is.

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,200
Contact, shared between the two of you alone.

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,800
Reciprocal aid dot network.
